        <h2 class="split__title rv" id="s1-title">DevSecOps Services for Integrated Security Across the Software Development Lifecycle</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="split__body prose">
        <p class="rv">DevSecOps (Development, Security and Operations) is a software development approach that integrates security practices into every stage of the Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC), from initial code development to testing, deployment and ongoing maintenance. It combines development and operations workflows with automated security controls to identify vulnerabilities early and reduce security risks before software reaches production.</p>
        <p class="rv">Our DevSecOps services help organizations integrate security into CI/CD pipelines through automated vulnerability scanning and secure code analysis alongside container security and Infrastructure as Code (IaC) assessments. As an experienced DevSecOps company, we implement security testing and continuous monitoring practices that help development teams detect misconfigurations and address vulnerabilities while maintaining efficient release cycles. This approach supports secure software delivery and strengthens application security across cloud-native and enterprise environments.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

