<section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="s2-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta"></div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s2-title">Comprehensive DevSecOps Services for Secure Software Delivery</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Our DevSecOps services integrate security controls into development pipelines and cloud infrastructure to identify vulnerabilities early and reduce risks across the software delivery lifecycle. We cover the following key areas to support secure application development and deployment.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="ledger ledger--10">
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("pipeline") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">CI/CD Pipeline Security</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We secure continuous integration and continuous delivery pipelines by identifying exposed credentials and reviewing pipeline permissions while integrating automated security checks into build and deployment workflows.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("code") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Static Application Security Testing (SAST)</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Our DevSecOps approach integrates SAST tools into development workflows to analyze source code for security vulnerabilities and coding weaknesses before applications are deployed.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("app-target") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Dynamic Application Security Testing (DAST)</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We test running applications to identify exploitable vulnerabilities such as injection flaws and authentication weaknesses by simulating real-world attack scenarios within authorized testing environments.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("dependency") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Software Composition Analysis (SCA)</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We assess open-source libraries and third-party dependencies to identify known vulnerabilities and outdated components while supporting software license compliance and dependency risk management.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("iac") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Infrastructure as Code (IaC) Security</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We scan infrastructure configuration files such as Terraform and CloudFormation templates to detect insecure settings and policy violations before cloud resources are provisioned.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("container") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Container and Kubernetes Security</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">We assess container images and Kubernetes configurations for vulnerabilities and excessive permissions while integrating image scanning and deployment security policies into DevSecOps pipelines.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
