<section class="section section--white" aria-labelledby="s3-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process process--light">
      <div class="process__aside">
        <h2 class="process__title" id="s3-title">Our DevSecOps Implementation Process</h2>
        <p class="process__lede">CipherTrivia follows a structured DevSecOps implementation process that integrates security into every stage of the Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC). Our approach combines security assessments and automated testing with continuous validation to identify vulnerabilities early and support secure software delivery.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="process__list" data-process>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Security Assessment and Planning</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We assess your existing development workflows, application architecture and deployment infrastructure to identify security gaps and define a DevSecOps strategy aligned with your technical requirements.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Security Integration</h3>
          <p class="step__text">Our team integrates security controls into CI/CD pipelines and development workflows while incorporating secure coding practices and vulnerability detection tools into the software delivery process.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Automated Security Testing</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We implement automated SAST, DAST and Software Composition Analysis (SCA) to detect insecure code and vulnerable dependencies alongside configuration weaknesses before production deployment.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Vulnerability Remediation</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We analyze identified security vulnerabilities and prioritize them based on severity and potential business impact. Our team provides actionable remediation guidance to help developers resolve security issues efficiently.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Continuous Monitoring and Improvement</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We support continuous security monitoring and recurring pipeline assessments to identify emerging risks while improving security policies and maintaining consistent protection across development and production environments.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

